{
  "id": "dali_granny",
  "title": "民居巷 · 带上纸笔",
  "on_end": {
    "type": "none"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "主角",
      "text": "阿婆，您好。想跟您打听周城做扎染的那位婆婆。",
      "source_line": "D02"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "民居巷阿婆",
      "text": "你找她做布，还是问花样？",
      "source_line": "D03",
      "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "主角",
      "text": "问花样。您看看这张照片，她会不会认得？",
      "source_line": "D04"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "民居巷阿婆",
      "text": "这个得让她自己看。我跟她来往这么多年，也认不得。",
      "source_line": "D05",
      "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "主角",
      "text": "她平时愿意跟人讲这些吗？",
      "source_line": "D06"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "民居巷阿婆",
      "text": "愿意啊。就是你问她一句怎么做，她嘴上还没说完，手上已经做了好几步。",
      "source_line": "D07",
      "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "主角",
      "text": "那我得慢慢记。",
      "source_line": "D08"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "民居巷阿婆",
      "text": "对。给她一张纸，让她画给你看。你有没看明白的，当面问。",
      "source_line": "D09",
      "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "民居巷阿婆",
      "text": "她老说记得住，可别人不一定跟得上。",
      "source_line": "D10",
      "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "主角",
      "text": "我想把花样和她讲的话一起留下，再请她核对。",
      "source_line": "D11"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "民居巷阿婆",
      "text": "这就好。她坊门口晾着蓝白布，顺着路过去就看见了。",
      "source_line": "D12",
      "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "主角",
      "text": "谢谢阿婆，我过去看看。",
      "source_line": "D13"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "民居巷阿婆",
      "text": "去吧。她做起活来不看钟，你可得记着歇一歇。",
      "source_line": "D14",
      "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png"
    }
  ],
  "stage": {
    "portrait": "res://assets/characters/dali/granny-v01.png",
